    "terrainName": "cqb-village",
    "description": "What: On cqb-village, 'Blue Platoon' (Friend, Regular, 3 squads of 4) runs UrbanMovement (CE-2284) east down Main Street to the Cross Road (200,190), then south down it to (200,110); 2 Militia insurgents in SNP (x 300..310, y 204..214), ~100 m off the route, fire on it. Judge: (1) a squad fired on senses FiredOnFromStructure and reports it; (2) the platoon does NOT react with ReactToFireFromBuilding \u2014 the building is off the route and the platoon is Regular, so it bypasses (DA-18; no smoke yet, CE-2278); (3) the squad in contact fights its own drill and the movement reaches the route's end. Fail: a squad is sent into SNP, or the movement never ends. Check: the twin PlatoonScenarioTests.CE2284_PcAmbushBypass_*"
